<title>USA: Arrow Transportation names Erwin president.</title>
<headline>Arrow Transportation names Erwin president.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arrow Transportation Co said John Erwin was promoted to president and chief operating officer, filling a vacancy created last year when Sal Cincotta was relieved of his duties.</p>
<p>Erwin has served as senior vice president with responsibility for marketing and operations since he joined the company in 1993.</p>
